File headers. Every C++, Python and CMake source outside extern/ carries one,
setup.py and CMakeLists.txt included, checked in CI (.github/workflows/lint.yml)
by ament_copyright and, for CMakeLists.txt, tools/ci/check_copyright_headers.py:
  - written here: "Copyright <year> Hyunho Cho" and the Apache-2.0 notice;
  - adapted from upstream: the upstream copyright line(s), then
    "Copyright <year> Hyunho Cho", the upstream license in full, and a
    "Derived from ... see NOTICE" line;
  - extern/ is never edited.
A package whose files carry more than one license lists each in package.xml.


